{"id":4684,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?p=4684"},"modified":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","modified_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","slug":"i-give-first","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/press-release\/i-give-first\/","title":{"rendered":"I Give First"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4685\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/englewoodcoc.png\" alt=\"englewoodcoc\" width=\"250\" height=\"137\" \/><\/p>\n<p>There is no way to fully express our gratitude for your excellent service. Your support played a key role in the success of our event (Breasts of Georgia). We at The Greater Englewood Chamber are continually inspired by the dedication and generosity of people like you who answer the call to give, again and again.<\/p>\n<p>Your DJ\u2019s demeanor was that of a professional, with an extensive music collection, and playing several types of music, especially catering to our event. We can&#8217;t thank you enough and would highly recommend you and your professional crew to anyone and everyone.<\/p>\n<p>Our Breasts of Georgia event raised over $9053, all of which went directly to Sense of Security, a support organization for breast cancer survivors. And we collected close to 2000 bras which were given to women shelters all over Denver.<\/p>\n<p>We also want to thank you for handling situations that arose during our event planning, your professional personality and experience quickly smoothed over any tension or anxiety.We have received many favorable remarks about your DJ\u2019s service and the style in which it was delivered; I hope we can arrange to have you at another event in the near future.<\/p>\n<p>Thanks again,<br \/>\nSincerely,<br \/>\nRosemarie Cabral,<br \/>\nPresident<br \/>\nThe Greater Englewood Chamber of Commerce<\/p>\n<p>Colleen Mello<br \/>\nExecutive Director<br \/>\nThe Greater Englewood Chamber of Commerce<br \/>\n3501 S. Broadway 2nd Floor, Englewood, CO 80013<br \/>\n303-789-4473.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>There is no way to fully express our gratitude for your excellent service. Your support played a key role in the success of our event (Breasts of Georgia). We at The Greater Englewood Chamber are continually inspired by the dedication and generosity of people like you who answer the call to give, again and again.&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":4685,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[22],"tags":[32,33,38,78],"class_list":["post-4684","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-press-release","tag-giveback","tag-igivefirst","tag-volunteer","tag-charity"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>I Give First - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/press-release\/i-give-first\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"I Give First\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"There is no way to fully express our gratitude for your excellent service. Your support played a key role in the success of our event (Breasts of Georgia). We at The Greater Englewood Chamber are continually inspired by the dedication and generosity of people like you who answer the call to give, again and again.&hellip;\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/press-release\/i-give-f